The numbers is a list of 4, 2, 5, and 7.
The size is the number of items in numbers.
The answer is a list of size zeros.
The even is 0.
The odd is 1.
For each value in numbers.
If value modulo 2 is 0, set item even of answer to value, add 2 to even.
If value modulo 2 is 1, set item odd of answer to value, add 2 to odd.

For each value in answer, show value.
